/* Help. */
"Help.01" = "De'wI' tetlhDaq «poSmoH…» wIv pagh ⌘O yIlo', ngutlh tu'qom ngeHmey poSmoHlaH, pagh ngutlh tu'qom Degh app 'och pagh poSmoHta'bogh ngutlh tu'qom jIHHomDaq qeng 'e' laH. appvam laDlaHbogh mIw wa'DIch chenmoH 'e' tIv. qen DapoSmoHbogh ngutlh tu'qom poSmoHqa'meH «qen DapoSmoHbogh ngutlh tu'qom poSmoH» yIlo'.";
