"Help.03" = "ngutlh tu'qom choHlaHbogh poSmoHDI', qul Doq 'ej qul SuD bIngDaq ngutlh tu'qom choHbogh pat tu'lu', 'ej pe'laH. mI' wIvDI', ↑/↓ pagh ⇧↑/⇧↓ yIlo' mI' choHmeH.";
"Help.04" = "retlh tetlhDaq wa' ngutlh pagh ngutlhmey law' yIchel Hoch Degh qellu'bogh leghmeH. ⌥⏎ yIlo' tlhegh chu' chenmoHmeH, 'ej nIH leQ yI'uy «ghItlh pollu'ta'bogh» tu'meH—DaH ghItlh pol pagh ghItlh pollu'ta'bogh yIchel. De'wI' tetlhDaq ⌥ yIlo' nom Qaw'meH. ⇥ je ⇧⇥ je yIlo' qawlu'bogh ghItlhmey choHmeH.";
"Help.05" = "DeghDaq 'eQway' leQ cha'logh yI'uy pagh Degh yIwIv 'ej ⏎ yI'uy; Degh motlh qa' Deghvam, 'ej latlh Deghmey lucha'lu'. Deghvam chelmeH, bIvangtaHvIS ⇧ yI'uytaH.";
"Help.06" = "↑/↓ yIlo' Degh Dung/bIng wIvmeH, ⌥↑/⌥↓ yIlo' Degh motlh Dung/bIng wIvmeH, ⌘↑/⌘↓ yIlo' Degh tetlh wa'DIch 'ej Qav Degh wIvmeH.";
"Help.07" = "UnicodeDaq 'eQway' tamDI', Unicode pat pong 'agh. ⌘C yIlo' wIvta'bogh Degh Hoch Unicode mI' mu'mey latlh chenmoHmeH.";
"Help.08" = "nIH leQ yI'uy choHmeH, pagh ⌘1 wa' Degh, ⌘2 ngutlhmey, ⌘3 Degh tetlh yIlo'. ⌃⌘S: retlh 'ang / retlh So'.";
"Help.09" = "⌃⌘G: He ghoS yIchu' pagh yIchu'Ha'. He ghoS chu'lu'DI', ngutlhmey pagh Degh tetlhDaq Degh yI'uyqa' wa' Degh leghmeH. ⌘] je ⌘[ je yIlo' tlhopDaq ghoSmeH pagh cheghmeH; chegh leQ yIlo'laH je. chegh leQDaq nIH leQ yI'uy pagh leQ yI'uytaH qawHaq leghmeH.";
"Help.10" = "ngutlhmeyDaq Degh yIlo' wa'logh, latlh Deghmey legh. Sen per ngaS. nIH leQ yI'uy pagh ⌘5 yIlo' choHmeH. ghItlh per ngutlh tu'qom SeH je naDev tu'lu'. De'wI' tetlh «legh» latlh wIv ngaS.";
"Help.11" = "Degh tetlhDaq Degh yIlo' cha'logh, ghItlhta'bogh yIchel. retlh tetlhDaq Degh DawIvDI', Degh tetlhDaq bar Degh. nIH leQ yI'uy «SeH wIv» tu'meH.";
"Help.12" = "⌘+/⌘− yIlo' ghItlh tInmoH/machmoH, pagh 'eQway' tlhej. ngutlhmeyDaq ⌥⌘+/⌥⌘− pagh 'eQway' tlhej per tInmoH/machmoH, ⌃⌘+/⌃⌘− pagh 'eQway' tlhej tlhegh tInmoH/machmoH. ⌘0 motlh tIn wIv.";
